{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t明天是大埔宏福苑火災一周年，行政長官李家超，日前探訪宏福苑居民，了解他們的近況及新居安排進展。<br/>\n<br/>\n李家超表示，政府一方面加快長遠房屋配置，協助居民盡早展開新生活，同時透過修訂六條法例，嚴堵樓宇維修漏洞，防止同類事件重演。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T11:54:47.987314+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T11:38:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T20:08:36.596836+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T11:48:13.172350+00:00","content_hash":"0c41d9bed8f828a170e61ade24cf03ca6d866bf78ebf8b0ddc8c7a1c1827a477","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}